# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file. 

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/) 
and this project adheres to 
[Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## Unreleased
### Added
- Added a README.md based in part on 
  [David Larlet's README](https://github.com/davidbgk/open-source-template/) 
  and [Shaloo Shalini's Structured 
  README](https://github.com/shaloo/structuredreadme).
- Added a CHANGELOG based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/).
- Adopted [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/).
- Adopted the [Unlicense](http://unlicense.org/).
- Added a MAINTENANCE.md based on
  [Django's Code of Conduct Enforcement Manual](https://www.djangoproject.com/conduct/enforcement-manual/)
- Adopted the [Contributor Covenant Code of Conduct](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/1/4/code-of-conduct.md)
